# REST Client requests: click "Send Request" above each block in VS Code.
# These endpoints become available once the backend app is built (next stage).
@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health check
GET {{base}}/api/health

### List public project information
GET {{base}}/api/projects

### Submit a contact message
POST {{base}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Visitor",
  "email": "visitor@example.com",
  "message": "Hello! This is a test message from the REST Client."
}
